WEBVTT

00:18:29.896 --> 00:18:33.817
including my grandmother,
my mother, my friends.

00:18:34.818 --> 00:18:36.653
All of us.

00:18:36.653 --> 00:18:38.822
Because, yeah, war is ugly.

00:18:38.822 --> 00:18:42.075
And it was the men who created the war.

00:18:42.075 --> 00:18:44.077
It was the men who made peace.

00:18:44.119 --> 00:18:45.745
We always pushed for it.

00:18:45.787 --> 00:18:49.291
But then there was no space
for us [at] the table,

00:18:49.332 --> 00:18:51.543
no matter how hard we pushed for it.

00:18:51.585 --> 00:18:56.214
But it doesn't mean
that we give up and it's done.

00:18:56.256 --> 00:18:59.384
And we are, you know ...
We made peace with that.

00:18:59.426 --> 00:19:01.303
It was the spirit of the whole country.